  "content": "[Intro]\n[D5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D5]Mortified by the\nlack of conscience Our\nsanctity\nbears no relevance\n\n[Bridge]\n[D5]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D5]Insignificance is\nour existence\nHear the litany of\nlife's persistence\n\n[Bridge]\n[D5]\nOur\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Eb5]pleas for mercy\nfall upon unhear\ning ears\nTake my life, my soul,\nwipe away these bit-\nter tears\n\n[Bridge]\n[D5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[D5]Vanquished in the\nname of your god\nOne of the same to\nwhom we all pray\n\n[Solo]\n[D5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[D5]Vanquished in the\nname of your god\nOne of the same to\nwhom we all pray\n\n[Verse 4]\n[Eb5]Try to close my mind\nfrom the screams I hear\nRepentance is denied,\nthe\nconformation\nof my fear\n\n[Bridge]\n[D5]\n\n[Outro]\n[D5]",
